          "en": "On one of the nights of Makkah before the Hijra, the Prophet ﷺ was taken by night from the Sacred Mosque to the Farthest Mosque, and then raised up to the heavens[^umari]. The Qur'an recorded the Night Journey at the opening of the surah that bears its name:"
