          "en": "In Abu Hurayrah's report he ﷺ was brought, [\"on the night he was taken on the Night Journey, at Iliya', two cups of wine and milk. He looked at them and took the milk. Jibril said: Praise be to Allah who guided you to the fitrah; had you taken the wine, your Ummah would have gone astray.\"](h:bukhari:4709) [Iliya'](g:iliya) is Jerusalem."
