          "en": "He ﷺ said: [\"I passed by Musa on the night I was taken on the Night Journey, at the red sand-hill, standing in prayer in his grave.\"](h:muslim:2375) And he ﷺ led the prophets in prayer: [\"I saw myself among a group of the prophets … the time of prayer came and I led them.\"](h:muslim:172) Al-Qadi 'Iyad said: he may have prayed with them in Jerusalem and then ascended to the heavens, or his prayer with them may have been after he came down from heaven[^fath:7/209]."
